 "source": "# Binary chains, keyword vs punctuator boolean, unary, safe navigation.\n# `and`/`or` are not rewritten to `&&`/`||`.\n\nsimple = a + b # tight in the source, spaced in the output of normalisation\n\narithmetic_chain =\n  first_operand + second_operand + third_operand + fourth_operand +\n    fifth_operand\n\nmixed_precedence = alpha + beta * gamma - delta / epsilon + zeta * eta\n\nboolean_and = condition_one && condition_two && condition_three && condition_four\n\nboolean_or = first_option || second_option || third_option || fourth_option\n\nkeyword_and = condition_one and condition_two\nkeyword_or = first_option or second_option\n\nunary = -value\nbang = !some_condition_that_is_fairly_long\nnot_expr = (not some_condition)\n\nsafe = user&.profile&.address&.city\n\nop_assign = x += 1\n\nrange = 1..10\nexcl = 1...10\n",
